#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special3.df:160
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special3.df"
msgid ""
"Special offer today, good for one person!\r\n"
"\tI can give you a crash course in boxing! You'll learn how to punch, and I'll throw in some intense exercise to strengthen you, increase energy, and toughen you up!\r\n"
"\tAll for 20 food!"
