"\t전부 식량 20개면 돼!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special3.df:165
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special3.df"
msgid "Give 20 food for boxing training!"
msgstr "식량 20개로 복싱 훈련 받기!"

