#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df:162
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df"
msgid "IMMEDIATELY EXPLODES!"
msgstr "즉시 폭발한다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df:162
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df"
msgid " Real Mature!"
msgstr " 참 어른스럽네!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df:164
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df"
msgid " gets burnt up in a big fireball! However, "
msgstr "은(는) 거대한 화염구에 불탄다! 하지만 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df:164
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df"
msgid ""
" is alive and only mildly irritated.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"는 멀쩡히 살아 있고 조금 짜증이 날 뿐이다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df:165
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df"
msgid "'s skin feels strangely cool."
msgstr "의 피부가 이상할 정도로 시원하다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df:167
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df"
msgid "OW! DANG IT!"
msgstr "아야! 이런 젠장!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df:169
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df"
msgid ""
" gets engulfed in a fireball! Of course, this doesn't do anything.\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 화염구에 휩싸인다! 물론 아무 영향도 없다.\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df:170
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df"
msgid " feels pretty smug about this."
msgstr "은(는) 이게 꽤 뿌듯하다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df:177
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df"
msgid "Strange Arcade Machine"
msgstr "기묘한 게임기"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df:179
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df"
msgid ""
"This is an new looking arcade machine. There are giant letters onscreen that"
" spell out: "
msgstr "이 게임기는 새것처럼 보인다. 화면에 거대한 글씨가 떠 있다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df:179
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df"
msgid "FIRE EXPLODERS"
msgstr "파이어 익스플로더스"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df:179
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\tThis machine has been converted to run on food, so the coin slot is enormous. There's only one button. Instead of any sort of gameplay, the machine displays a roaring fire behind the title..."
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t식량으로 작동하도록 개조되어 있어 동전 투입구가 엄청나게 크다. 버튼은 딱 하나다. 게임 화면 대신 제목 뒤로 맹렬한 불길이 타오른다..."

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df:186
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df"
msgid " plays for 10 food"
msgstr "은(는) 식량 10개로 게임하기"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df:190
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df"
msgid "An flying axe spins closer and closer, and then "
msgstr "날아오는 도끼가 빙글빙글 돌며 다가오더니 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df:190
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df"
msgid "FLIES THROUGH THE SCREEN!"
msgstr "화면을 뚫고 튀어나온다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df:190
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df"
msgid " They don't make games like this anymore!"
msgstr " 요즘엔 이런 게임 안 만들지!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df:192
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df"
msgid " is physically fit enough to deflect the axe. "
msgstr "은(는) 체력이 충분해 도끼를 쳐낸다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df:192
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df"
msgid " feels very happy that the axe was handle first, not blade first."
msgstr "는 날이 아닌 손잡이 쪽이 먼저 날아와서 정말 다행이라고 느낀다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df:194
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df"
msgid ""
" gets smashed right in the face by the axe, handle first! The arcade worker "
"is pretty happy about this, as it's less cleanup than the other end would "
"have required."
msgstr "은(는) 도끼 손잡이에 얼굴을 정통으로 맞는다! 오락실 직원은 꽤 기뻐한다. 반대쪽이었다면 청소가 훨씬 힘들었을 테니까."

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df:197
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df"
msgid "The screen glitches out as the axe clatters to the floor."
msgstr "도끼가 바닥에 덜그럭 떨어지자 화면이 이상해진다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df:205
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df"
msgid "DIFFICULTY SELECT"
msgstr "난이도 선택"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df:207
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df"
msgid ""
"This machine gives an 80's vibe. There are golden letters onscreen that "
"spell out: "
msgstr "이 게임기에는 80년대 감성이 있다. 화면에 황금빛 글씨가 떠 있다: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df:207
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df"
msgid "SHINY*AXE"
msgstr "샤이니*액스"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df:207
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df"
msgid ""
"\r\n"
"\tThe arcade machine seems to run on tokens from a different arcade chain. "
msgstr ""
"\r\n"
"\t다른 오락실 체인의 전용 토큰으로 작동하는 것 같다. "

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df:208
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df"
msgid ""
" notices this and turns to look at the arcade worker, who just gives a "
"listless shrug and looks away."
msgstr "은(는) 이를 알아채고 오락실 직원을 바라본다. 직원은 무기력하게 어깨를 으쓱하고 시선을 돌릴 뿐이다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df:209
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df"
msgid "Someone must have put a token in before you got here, the screen says "
msgstr "누군가 미리 토큰을 넣은 모양이다. 화면에 뜬 문구는 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df:209
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df"
msgid "ONE CREDIT REMAINING!"
msgstr "남은 크레딧 1개!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df:209
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df"
msgid " and "
msgstr " 그리고 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df:209
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df"
msgid "SELECT A DIFFICULTY:"
msgstr "난이도 선택:"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df:211
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df"
msgid " plays on NORMAL mode"
msgstr "은(는) 보통 난이도로 게임하기"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df:212
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df"
msgid " plays on HARD mode"
msgstr "은(는) 어려움 난이도로 게임하기"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df:219
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df"
msgid "Arcade Worker"
msgstr "오락실 직원"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df:220
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df"
msgid ""
"I'm bringing arcades back! They're going to get really popular now that the internet has been destroyed.\r\n"
"\t\r\n"
"\tNo refunds."
msgstr ""
"오락실을 부활시킬 거야! 인터넷이 망했으니 이제 엄청 인기 있을걸.\r\n"
"\t\r\n"
"\t환불은 안 돼."

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df:267
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df"
msgid "THE LAST "
msgstr "최후의 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df:267
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special5.df"
msgid "ARCADE"
msgstr "오락실"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special6.df:68
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special6.df"
msgid ""
" uses their skills to figure out how to reset the turret into its deployable state!\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 기술을 활용해 포탑을 휴대 상태로 되돌리는 방법을 알아낸다!\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special6.df:69
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special6.df"
msgid "FREE TURRET!"
msgstr "공짜 포탑!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special6.df:71
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special6.df"
msgid ""
" tries to use brute force to smoosh the turret back into its carrying state!\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 힘으로 포탑을 구겨서 휴대 상태로 만들려고 한다!\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special6.df:72
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special6.df"
msgid "GRAAAAAAAAAAAAAH!"
msgstr "그아아아아아아!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special6.df:74
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special6.df"
msgid "Amazingly, this actually works!"
msgstr "놀랍게도 정말 된다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special6.df:76
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special6.df"
msgid "This works about as well as you'd expect it to. In addition, "
