#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special6.df:95
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special6.df"
msgid ""
" buys a Napalm Thrower modded for double capacity!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 용량을 두 배로 개조한 네이팜 방사기를 산다!\r\n"
"\t"

