msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special6.df"
msgid "Talk about friendly FIRE! Seriously, watch out for teammates."
msgstr "아군도 화끈하게 태우지! 진짜로, 동료는 조심해."

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special6.df:101
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special6.df"
msgid ""
" buys a bazooka modded with eight rockets!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 로켓 여덟 발을 넣도록 개조한 바주카를 산다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special6.df:102
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special6.df"
msgid "TOTAL carnage! I love it!"
msgstr "완전한 대학살! 아주 좋아!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special6.df:107
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special6.df"
msgid ""
" buys a grenade launcher modded with 15 grenades!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 유탄 15발을 넣도록 개조한 유탄 발사기를 산다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special6.df:108
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special6.df"
