msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special6.df"
msgid ""
"I've modded all of these already DEVASTATING weapons to have double capacity"
" or more! You can't get these anywhere else!"
msgstr "원래도 파괴적인 이 무기들을 전부 용량 두 배 이상으로 개조했어! 다른 데선 못 구하지!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special6.df:115
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special6.df"
msgid "NOW we're talking."
msgstr "이제야 말이 통하네."

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special6.df:118
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special6.df"
msgid " is DEVASTATED to learn that they can't afford anything."
msgstr "은(는) 아무것도 살 수 없다는 사실에 처참하게 좌절한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special6.df:120
#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special6.df:161
#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special6.df:203
#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special6.df:285
