"은(는) 검진을 받지만 아무 이상도 없다. 의사는 시간을 낭비시켰다며 대놓고 화를 내고 모욕감을 드러내며 차트에 뭔가 끄적인다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:151
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid " gets treatment for "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:153
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid "all"
msgstr "모든"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:155
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid "most"
msgstr "대부분의"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:157
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid " of their wounds."
msgstr " 상처를 치료받는다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:158
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid ""
"The doctor is incredibly disappointed and bored by your commonplace "
"injuries."
msgstr "의사는 흔하디흔한 부상에 몹시 실망하고 지루해한다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:162
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid "BUT WAIT! "
msgstr "잠깐만! "

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:163
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid ""
"The Troubled Genius Doctor detects an illness!\r\n"
"\t\tAfter about 44 minutes, the doctor comes to a an exciting conclusion: The illness was "
msgstr ""
"고뇌하는 천재 의사가 질병을 발견한다!\r\n"
"\t\t약 44분 뒤, 의사는 흥미진진한 결론에 도달한다. 병명은 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:164
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid "COFFEE POISONING! "
msgstr "커피 중독! "

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:165
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid "The doctor administers an experimental miracle superserum to "
msgstr "의사는 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:165
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid ""
"! It doesn't cure the illness, but a single day of rest will do that, "
"anyway."
msgstr "에게 실험용 기적의 슈퍼 혈청을 투여한다! 병을 치료하진 못하지만, 어차피 하루만 쉬면 낫는 병이다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:172
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid "Probably a Troubled Genius Doctor"
msgstr "아마도 고뇌하는 천재 의사"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:173
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid ""
"I've been treating nothing but zombie bites, some light burns, propane tank injuries, and stubbed toes for what feels like 6 years now.\r\n"
"\tTell me you have any sort of disease. Ideally a dramatic mystery disease, but even something like food poisoning would be great at this point. Anything but another zombie bite!"
msgstr ""
"6년쯤 된 것 같아. 좀비에게 물린 상처, 가벼운 화상, 프로판 탱크 부상, 찧은 발가락만 치료했지.\r\n"
"\t아무 질병이나 있다고 해 줘. 극적인 원인 불명의 병이면 최고지만, 이젠 식중독 정도도 반가워. 또 좀비에게 물린 것만 아니면 돼!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:177
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid " lacks enough food for medical treatment!"
msgstr "은(는) 치료받을 식량이 부족하다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:178
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid " The doctor takes pity on "
msgstr " 의사는 딱하게 여겨 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:178
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid " and hands out some medical supplies."
msgstr "에게 의약품을 조금 건네준다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:182
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid "Get injuries treated - 5 food"
msgstr "부상 치료받기 - 식량 5개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:184
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid "Get the group's injuries treated - 5 food"
msgstr "일행의 부상 치료받기 - 식량 5개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:197
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid ""
" is flooded with nostalgic flavors. At first, the entire meal seems to have a strange, stale aftertaste, but you'd have to be a fool to think that this wasn't intentional. It's all part of the subtle appeal of it, the masterful crafting of it not as a mere meal, but as a Total Food Experience!\r\n"
"\tThere's even an extra jello! One Red flavor, one Yellow flavor! Incredible!"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 추억의 맛에 휩싸인다. 처음에는 식사 전체에 이상하고 오래 묵은 뒷맛이 느껴진다. 하지만 이게 의도된 맛이 아니라고 생각하는 건 바보다. 모두 이 식사의 은은한 매력이다. 단순한 식사가 아닌, 총체적인 음식 체험으로 빚어낸 장인의 솜씨!\r\n"
"\t젤리도 하나 더 있다! 빨간 맛 하나, 노란 맛 하나! 놀랍다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:207
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid "Who should get to eat the Hospital Cafeteria Food?"
msgstr "누가 병원 식당 음식을 먹을까?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:208
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid ""
"THIS FOOD OF THE GODS WILL CONFER A BONUS TO MAXIMUM HEALTH, AND A MASSIVE "
"MORALE RESTORE!"
msgstr "신들의 음식이다! 최대 체력이 늘고 사기가 엄청나게 회복된다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:220
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid "Cleaning Up"
msgstr "청소 시간"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:221
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid ""
" spins her mop rapidly around her wrist.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 손목 주위로 대걸레를 빠르게 돌린다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:222
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid ""
"Time to clean up this mess!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"이 난장판을 청소할 시간이야!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:223
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid "Mop water soaks "
msgstr "대걸레 물이 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:223
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid " pretty bad."
msgstr "을(를) 흠뻑 적신다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:227
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid ""
"The group is full.\r\n"
"\t\tWho would you like to replace to make room for "
msgstr ""
"일행이 꽉 찼다.\r\n"
"\t\t자리를 비우려면 누구를 빼야 할까? 들어올 사람: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:232
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid "That seemed really easy."
msgstr "아주 쉬워 보였다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:234
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid " convinces "
msgstr "은(는) "

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:234
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid " a to sneak out some Hospital Food!"
msgstr "에게 병원 음식을 몰래 빼돌리도록 설득한다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:235
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid "GIVE ME THAT HOSPITAL FOOD"
msgstr "병원 음식 내놔"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:243
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid "The Cafeteria Food Black Market"
msgstr "식당 음식 암시장"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:245
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid ""
"There is a cleaning lady in here. She doesn't seem to actually be working. "
"She sizes "
msgstr "청소부 아주머니가 있다. 정작 청소는 하지 않는 것 같다. 그녀는 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:245
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid " up."
msgstr "을(를) 위아래로 훑어본다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:247
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid ""
"Uh huh. Wow, you have a serious problem.\r\n"
"\t\tI can get you another one, but it will cost you."
msgstr ""
"그렇구나. 와, 너 문제 심각한데.\r\n"
"\t\t하나 더 구해 줄 수 있지만, 값은 내야 해."

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:250
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid ""
"I know what you're REALLY here for. You've come all the way here for the hospital food.\r\n"
"\t\tI can sneak you the cafeteria meal you crave, for a price."
msgstr ""
"진짜 용건은 알고 있어. 병원 음식 먹으려고 여기까지 왔지.\r\n"
"\t\t돈만 내면 네가 갈망하는 식당 음식을 몰래 빼돌려 줄게."

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:255
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid "Buy the Cafeteria Food - "
msgstr "식당 음식 사기 - "

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:255
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid " non-cafeteria food"
msgstr " 일반 식량"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:256
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid "Refuse to do this on principle"
msgstr "원칙을 지켜 거절하기"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:258
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid "Can't spare the food"
msgstr "식량을 줄 여유가 없다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:260
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid "Try to Recruit her"
msgstr "동료로 영입해 보기"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:275
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid ""
" mostly gets a crash course in golf trivia. Somehow, this feels applicable "
"to medical skill."
msgstr "은(는) 주로 골프 잡학을 속성으로 배운다. 어째서인지 의술에도 쓸모가 있을 것 같다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:277
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid ""
" has already got their full medical degree from SHBU!\r\n"
"\t\tHowever, the Our Saint of the Hospital Bathroom University does not issue refunds."
msgstr ""
"은(는) 이미 성스러운 병원 화장실 대학에서 의학 학위를 땄다!\r\n"
"\t\t하지만 이 대학의 수호성인은 환불을 해 주지 않는다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:284
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid ""
"The entire group gets medical training! It's almost entirely a group "
"pantomime of proper golfing technique."
msgstr "일행 전체가 의술을 배운다! 거의 내내 다 함께 올바른 골프 자세를 몸짓으로 흉내 낸다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:293
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid "Who should get this vast medical knowledge?"
msgstr "누가 이 방대한 의학 지식을 배울까?"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:298
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid "Saint Hospital Bathroom University"
msgstr "성스러운 병원 화장실 대학"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:299
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid ""
"Feh! Doctors! Big deal! I can teach you everything you need to know about "
"medicine, here in this bathroom, way better than in any quote-unquote "
"'UNIVERSITY'."
msgstr "흥! 의사! 별거 아니야! 의학에 필요한 모든 걸 여기 화장실에서 가르쳐 주지. 이름만 '대학'인 곳보다 훨씬 잘 말이야."

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:300
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid ""
"Spittle shoots out of their mouth when they say 'University'. You dimly "
"wonder how long they've been in this bathroom, and if they've washed their "
"hands."
msgstr "'대학'이라고 말할 때 침이 튄다. 이 사람이 얼마나 오래 이 화장실에 있었는지, 손은 씻었는지 문득 궁금해진다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:302
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid "You can't afford any more training."
msgstr "더 배울 식량이 부족하다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:306
#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:309
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid "Give "
msgstr "지불하기: "

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:306
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid " food for single training"
msgstr " 식량 - 개인 훈련"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df:309
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special7.df"
msgid " food for group training"
msgstr " 식량 - 단체 훈련"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special8.df:88
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special8.df"
msgid "Car for Sale"
msgstr "판매 중인 차"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special8.df:89
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special8.df"
msgid ""
"This car looks like it's both 'turnkey and good to go.'\r\n"
"\t\tYou could buy it from the nearby sleazy car salesman!"
msgstr ""
"이 차는 '열쇠만 돌리면 바로 출발'할 수 있어 보인다.\r\n"
"\t\t근처의 껄렁한 자동차 판매원에게 살 수 있다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special8.df:91
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special8.df"
msgid "Come back later"
msgstr "나중에 돌아오기"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special8.df:97
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special8.df"
msgid ""
" buys a brand new car!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 새 차를 산다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special8.df:98
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special8.df"
msgid "Just take whatever car off the lot that you want!"
msgstr "전시장에 있는 차 아무거나 골라서 가져가!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special8.df:103
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special8.df"
msgid "Every Car Must Go!"
msgstr "차 전부 처분합니다!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special8.df:104
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special8.df"
msgid ""
"I gotta get these cars off the lot! You can buy any car, right now, for the low, low price of 5 food! Get it now! No financing! Turnkey and good to go!\r\n"
"\tI'll even throw in 50 gas!"
msgstr ""
"이 차들을 전부 치워야 해! 지금 어떤 차든 단돈 식량 5개면 돼! 당장 사! 할부는 안 돼! 열쇠만 돌리면 바로 출발!\r\n"
"\t기름 50개도 덤으로 줄게!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special8.df:106
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special8.df"
msgid "That's quite a deal."
msgstr "꽤 괜찮은 거래다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special8.df:109
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special8.df"
msgid " can't afford the life-changing purchase of a shiny new car."
msgstr "은(는) 인생을 바꿔 줄 번쩍이는 새 차를 살 형편이 안 된다."

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special8.df:111
#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special8.df:141
#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special8.df:188
#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special8.df:248
#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special8.df:305
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special8.df"
msgid "Leave for now"
msgstr "일단 떠난다"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special8.df:113
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special8.df"
msgid "Buy a new car - 5 food"
msgstr "새 차 사기 - 식량 5개"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special8.df:119
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special8.df"
msgid ""
" pays for full chassis and engine repairs!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 차체와 엔진의 완전 수리 비용을 낸다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special8.df:120
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special8.df"
msgid ""
"When you leave here, just drive your car down the road a bit and we'll "
"repair it!"
msgstr "여길 떠나서 조금만 운전하면 우리가 수리해 줄게!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special8.df:125
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special8.df"
msgid ""
" pays for an array of advanced car modifications, plus full chassis and engine repairs!\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"은(는) 각종 고급 개조와 차체, 엔진의 완전 수리 비용을 낸다!\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special8.df:126
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special8.df"
msgid ""
"When you leave here, just drive down the road a bit to the garage. Your car "
"will get THE WORKS!"
msgstr "여길 떠나서 조금만 가면 정비소가 있어. 네 차에 풀코스로 해 줄게!"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special8.df:131
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special8.df"
msgid "Expert Garage"
msgstr "전문 정비소"

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special8.df:132
msgctxt "deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special8.df"
msgid ""
"We have a garage full of expert mechanics just down the road, and we offer "
msgstr "조금만 가면 전문 정비사로 가득한 정비소가 있어. 제공하는 서비스는 "

#: deathforth/events/trade/trader-camp-region-special8.df:132
